GUIDE_EN='''<p class="g-lead">You say when you want to eat. Tempasto tells you when to do what.</p><div class="g-sec"><span class="g-n">1</span><div><b>Plan</b><ul><li>On <b>Start</b> your plan is a single sentence. Tap a word underlined in red to change it.</li><li>Below it you see the key steps. Tap them for the full schedule.</li></ul></div></div><div class="g-sec"><span class="g-n">2</span><div><b>Pizzas and shopping</b><ul><li>Under <b>Pizzas</b> you choose what gets baked with <b>+</b>. Your own pizzas are at the end of the menu.</li><li>The shopping list writes itself. Long-press a line to mark it “always have it”.</li></ul></div></div><div class="g-sec"><span class="g-n">3</span><div><b>Baking</b><ul><li><b>Start plan</b> switches on the reminders. Bake mode then guides you step by step.</li><li>Behind <b>Done</b> there’s a note from Nonna. She explains every step in detail.</li><li>If things change, <b>Running late?</b> moves the whole plan.</li></ul></div></div><div class="g-sec"><span class="g-n">4</span><div><b>Settings</b><ul><li>Set oven, dough ball, yeast and kneading under <b>More → Recipe &amp; oven</b>. Preferment, flour, temperatures and units are in expert mode.</li></ul></div></div><button class="btn ghost" id="introOpen">Watch the short intro</button>'''
